claim.claim-text:
9. A surveillance unit, comprising:
a number of loads;
circuitry coupled to the number of loads, the circuitry including:
logic configured to reset at least one load of the number of loads;
a circuit configured to select one of a first power source or a second power source for providing power to one or more loads of the number of loads; and
a number of measurement devices for coupling to at least some loads of the number of loads.
